<title>THAILAND: Thai bourse halts trade in two more brokers.</title>
<headline>Thai bourse halts trade in two more brokers.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand halted trade in the shares of Bangkok Investment Plc and Thai Financial Syndicate Plc, market regulators said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The exchange said trading had been halted as the firms had failed to clarify a proposed merger with Prime Finance &amp; Securities Plc.</p>
<p>Prime was one of nine listed financially distressed finance and securities firms in which regulators suspended share trading earlier on Friday.</p>
</text>
